WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.506
Week 12: Shopping, Clothing, and Demonstratives. ask for an item and size compare price and fit return or exchange a purchase

2
00:00:08.506 --> 00:00:15.988
Form and meaning. Demonstratives; colors; numbers above one hundred; adjective placement; quedar and costar.

3
00:00:15.988 --> 00:00:41.009
Model set. ¿Tiene esta camisa en otra talla? Esos zapatos me quedan bien. Aquella chaqueta es demasiado cara. Quiero devolver este artículo. El precio incluye los impuestos. Do you have this shirt in another size? Those shoes fit me well. That jacket over there is too expensive. I want to return this item. The price includes taxes.

4
00:00:41.009 --> 00:00:51.139
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:51.139 --> 00:01:04.063
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: ask for an item and size; compare price and fit; return or exchange a purchase. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:29.703
Model language. ¿Tiene esta camisa en otra talla? — Do you have this shirt in another size? Esos zapatos me quedan bien. — Those shoes fit me well. Aquella chaqueta es demasiado cara. — That jacket over there is too expensive. Quiero devolver este artículo. — I want to return this item. El precio incluye los impuestos. — The price includes taxes.

7
00:01:29.703 --> 00:01:39.451
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
